    actual: `<!doctype html>\n<html lang="en">\n<head>\n  <meta charset="utf-8">\n  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">\n  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1c1e20">\n  <meta name="description" content="Play chess locally with a choice of neural policies and varied opening lines.">\n  <title>Chess Lab — Chess workspace</title>\n  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 40 40'%3E%3Crect width='40' height='40' fill='%231c1e20'/%3E%3Cpath d='M12 30h18M15 27l3-8-5-2 10-9 5 6-2 13z' fill='none' stroke='%23e8dfcc' stroke-width='3'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">\n  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style.css">\n  <script type="module" src="./app.mjs"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class="masthead">\n    <a class="wordmark" href="./" aria-label="Chess Lab home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">♞</span> CHESS <span class="brand-divider">/</span> <span class="brand-chess">LAB</span></a>\n    <span class="masthead-caption">Your board. Your move.</span>\n    <label class="sound-control"><input id="sound" type="checkbox"> Sound</label>\n  </header>\n  <main>\n    <div class="workspace-heading"><h1>Play chess</h1><span class="local-note">Local play · no account</span></div>\n\n    <div class="workspace">\n      <section class="board-column" aria-label="Chess game">\n        <div class="player-row" id="opponent-row"><div><span class="player-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◆</span><span id="opponent-name">Pocket</span><small id="opponent-color">Black</small></div><output class="clock" id="opponent-clock" aria-label="Black clock">3:00</output></div>\n        <div id="board" class="board" role="group" aria-label="Chessboard. Select a piece, then a destination. Use arrow keys to navigate and Enter to select."></div>\n        <div class="player-row" id="human-row"><div><span class="player-symbol human-symbol" aria-hidden="true">○</span><span>You</span><small id="human-color">White</small></div><output class="clock" id="human-clock" aria-label="White clock">3:00</output></div>\n        <div class="board-toolbar"><p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Ready to play</p><button id="flip" class="text-button" type="button" title="Flip board">Flip board <span aria-hidden="true">⇅</span></button></div>\n        <div class="premove-bar"><span id="premove-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Premoves ready</span><button id="cancel-premove" type="button" disabled>Cancel premove</button></div>\n        <p class="board-hint">Tap a piece, then a square · Arrow keys + Enter · Esc / right-click cancels</p>\n      </section>\n      <aside class="console" aria-label="Game controls and policy output">\n        <section class="setup-section" aria-labelledby="setup-heading">\n          <h2 id="setup-heading">Game setup</h2>\n          <div class="field-grid"><label>Play as<select id="color"><option value="w">White</option><option value="b">Black</option></select></label><label>Opponent<select id="model"><option value="pocket" selected>Pocket</option></select></label></div>\n          <label>Time control<select id="time-control"><option value="60,0">1 + 0 · Bullet</option><option value="180,2" selected>3 + 2 · Blitz</option><option value="300,0">5 + 0 · Blitz</option><option value="600,5">10 + 5 · Rapid</option><option value="unlimited">Unlimited</option><option value="custom">Custom…</option></select></label>\n          <div id="custom-time" class="field-grid" hidden><label>Minutes per side<input id="custom-minutes" type="number" min="0.05" max="180" step="0.05" value="5"></label><label>Increment (seconds)<input id="custom-increment" type="number" min="0" max="180" step="1" value="0"></label></div>\n          <label class="book-toggle"><input id="book" type="checkbox" checked> Opening book <span>Varied opening lines</span></label>\n          <label>Book source<select id="book-source" aria-describedby="book-source-help"><option value="eco" selected>ECO repertoire</option></select></label>\n          <p id="book-source-help" class="control-note">Offline snapshots only. A book miss uses the selected policy.</p>\n          <label class="book-toggle"><input id="premove" type="checkbox" checked aria-describedby="premove-help"> Premoves</label>\n          <p id="premove-help" class="control-note">Queue one move while your opponent thinks. Rechecked after their move; queued promotions become queens.</p>\n          <div class="game-actions"><button id="new-game" class="primary" type="button">Start game <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button id="resign" type="button" disabled>Resign</button></div>\n\n        </section>\n        <section class="notation-section" aria-labelledby="notation-heading"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="notation-heading"><span class="section-number">02</span> Notation</h2><button id="download-pgn" class="text-button" type="button">↓ PGN</button></div><div id="moves" class="moves" aria-label="Move list"><p class="empty-state">The first move is yours.</p></div></section>\n      </aside>\n    </div>\n    <details id="technical-panel"><summary>Analysis, positions &amp; technical details</summary>\n    <p class="control-note"><a href="./docs/RELEASE-V8.md">Current release &amp; weight comparisons ↗</a> · <a href="./docs/BOOK-SOURCES-V8.md">Book choices &amp; CC0 sources ↗</a></p>\n        <section class="policy-section" aria-labelledby="policy-heading"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="policy-heading">Move readout</h2><output id="latency">— ms</output></div><p class="source-line">Source <output id="move-source">—</output></p><div class="readout-labels"><span>Move</span><span id="score-label">Raw score</span></div><ol id="candidates" class="candidates"><li class="empty-state">Awaiting a move.</li></ol></section>\n    <section class="position-section" aria-labelledby="position-heading"><h2 id="position-heading">Position</h2><form id="fen-form"><label class="sr-only" for="fen">FEN position</label><input id="fen" type="text" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="fen-help" placeholder="Paste a FEN position…"><button type="submit">Load FEN</button></form><p id="fen-help">Imports start a new game with the selected settings. Repetition history before the imported position is unknown.</p></section>\n    <section id="method" class="reference-section"><h2>About Chess Lab</h2><p>Opening moves use a weighted, seeded book when enabled. Pocket/Atlas use sparse neural policies; DeepMind 9M scores legal state/action pairs in batches. Neither performs game-tree search. Everything runs on your device.</p><details><summary>Rules & clock conventions</summary><p>Legal moves and terminal positions use chess.js. Threefold repetition and the fifty-move rule are drawn automatically. Thinking and background-tab time count against the clock; increment follows a move made before flag fall. Timeout is a loss unless the whole position has insufficient material. Imported positions use fresh clocks and do not include earlier repetition history. Inference has a 30-second safety timeout, including Unlimited games.</p></details><p><a href="./docs/BROWSER-V6.md">Transformer methods & measured results ↗</a> · <a href="./evaluation/v0.8/final-results.json">Results data ↗</a> · <a href="https://github.com/clavum-figendi/chesslab">Source ↗</a></p></section>\n\n\n    <section class="reference-section" aria-labelledby="weights-heading"><h2 id="weights-heading">Models & downloads</h2><div id="model-downloads" class="model-downloads">Loading model information…</div><a href="./models/manifest.json" download>Model manifest ↓</a><p class="laptop-download"><a href="./downloads/astra-chess-laptop.zip" download>Download laptop runtime + models ↓</a></p><p class="control-note">Laptop: Node.js 22+. Run <code>node laptop/cli.mjs --list-models</code> to list models; use <code>--no-book</code> for pure policy play or <code>--seed example</code> to replay opening choices.</p></section>\n\n    <p class="laptop-download"><a href="https://github.com/clavum-figendi/chesslab/releases/download/v0.7.0/chess-lab-9m-laptop.zip">Download DeepMind 9M laptop bundle ↓</a> · Selected checkpoint, Python/PyTorch UCI runner, instructions and evidence.</p>\n    <details id="size-proposals" class="reference-section"><summary>Larger sizes: proposed, not built.</summary><p>Future model budgets and memory allowances are described in the <a href="./models/sizing-proposals.json">sizing proposals</a>.</p></details>\n    </details>\n  </main>\n  <footer><span>CHESS / LAB</span><span>Local play. Open source.</span><a href="#">Back to board ↑</a></footer>\n  <dialog id="promotion-dialog" aria-labelledby="promotion-title"><h2 id="promotion-title">Choose your promotion</h2><p>A pawn has reached the last rank.</p><div id="promotion-choices" class="promotion-choices"></div><button id="cancel-promotion" type="button">Cancel</button></dialog>\n  <dialog id="resign-dialog" aria-labelledby="resign-title"><h2 id="resign-title">Resign this game?</h2><p>The clock keeps running until you confirm.</p><div class="game-actions"><button id="confirm-resign" type="button" class="primary">Resign game</button><button id="cancel-resign" type="button">Keep playing</button></div></dialog>\n  <noscript>This chess workspace requires JavaScript. All inference runs locally; no external service is used.</noscript>\n</body>\n</html>\n`,
